WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.189
SightOps is an agentic visual reliability
engineer.

00:00:04.189 --> 00:00:08.172
You give it a photograph of a machine; it
measures what the image

00:00:08.172 --> 00:00:13.930
actually shows with OpenCV, reasons about
what it can and cannot see, and

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.554
decides what still needs to be inspected.

00:00:16.715 --> 00:00:19.782
And critically, it does not guess.

00:00:20.105 --> 00:00:24.043
The project began with a phone call about a
broken dishwasher.

00:00:24.043 --> 00:00:27.665
A photograph of a control panel is easy to
take and hard to

00:00:27.665 --> 00:00:30.858
read from a distance, and the person on the
other end of that

00:00:30.858 --> 00:00:33.343
call could not tell which light was on.

00:00:33.504 --> 00:00:38.974
SightOps turns that photograph into
evidence: what is lit and what is blank,

00:00:38.974 --> 00:00:43.130
where a needle points, how sharp and how
well exposed the frame is,

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:46.705
and how much of all of that you should
actually trust.

00:00:47.006 --> 00:00:51.988
Every measurement is real computer vision,
not a language model's impression.

00:00:52.079 --> 00:00:58.002
Perspective is detected and corrected, the
panel is located, blur and exposure are

00:00:58.002 --> 00:01:01.555
scored, and each region of interest is
rectified.

00:01:01.716 --> 00:01:06.466
A gauge reading comes from a radial scan
across the dial, with needle

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:13.014
shape validation. A lamp is classified by
hue segmentation and peak brightness, a

00:01:13.014 --> 00:01:16.439
switch from the angle of its lever, and a
display from its stroke

00:01:16.439 --> 00:01:21.420
level. When the vision model does speak, its
answer is labelled as inferred

00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:24.206
and never overwrites a measured value.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:29.697
Every measurement carries a confidence, and
the agent is allowed to distrust one.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:34.876
On the first photograph the gauge came back
at 83.7 PSI with only

00:01:34.876 --> 00:01:40.414
57 percent confidence, and two of the four
components sat below the floor.

00:01:40.505 --> 00:01:44.849
So SightOps marked the frame as needing a
better view, and wrote down

00:01:44.849 --> 00:01:49.876
why. A confident wrong pressure reading is
far worse than no reading at

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:50.317
all.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:53.068
This is the part that matters most.

00:01:53.068 --> 00:01:59.024
The agent compares image quality and
measurements across observations, decides
that the

00:01:59.024 --> 00:02:03.784
gauge cannot be trusted from this angle, and
asks for a better photograph.

00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:09.206
The inspection pauses in a waiting state,
with a specific request rather than

00:02:09.206 --> 00:02:14.825
a vague shrug: re-image the gauge square-on,
filling most of the frame, with

00:02:14.825 --> 00:02:18.447
diffuse light and no specular reflection
across the dial.

00:02:18.829 --> 00:02:22.813
A new photograph arrives, and this time the
view is clean.

00:02:22.846 --> 00:02:30.325
The gauge reads 87.2 PSI, above the 75 PSI
warning threshold, at 96

00:02:30.325 --> 00:02:35.932
percent confidence. The agent diffs the two
observations, sees the frame stop asking

00:02:35.932 --> 00:02:40.506
for a better view and the confidence on the
gauge climb from 0.57

00:02:40.506 --> 00:02:46.659
to 0.96, and replaces its earlier
uncertainty with a measurement it can
defend.

00:02:47.087 --> 00:02:52.964
That measurement is recorded as a diagnosis,
with its evidence attached: the region

00:02:52.964 --> 00:02:58.536
ids, the values, the confidences, and the
annotated image they came from.

00:02:58.627 --> 00:03:02.530
An incident is raised and a remediation is
proposed.

00:03:02.621 --> 00:03:07.685
Every claim in the trace is traceable to a
number that OpenCV produced,

00:03:07.685 --> 00:03:11.806
and to an image that a person can open and
check for themselves.

00:03:12.152 --> 00:03:19.271
Then SightOps stops. Consequential actions
require a person, so the agent requests
approval

00:03:19.271 --> 00:03:24.519
and waits for it. In this demonstration the
proposed action is simulated, and

00:03:24.519 --> 00:03:26.690
the interface says so plainly.

00:03:26.851 --> 00:03:31.914
Nothing is switched, no valve is turned, and
no safety interlock is ever

00:03:31.914 --> 00:03:37.522
bypassed, because a troubleshooting
assistant that can reach out and touch
machinery is

00:03:37.522 --> 00:03:39.658
a hazard, not a product.

00:03:39.912 --> 00:03:42.607
A human decides what happens next.

00:03:42.988 --> 00:03:48.459
The vision pipeline is measured on a
reproducible fixture set with exact ground

00:03:48.459 --> 00:03:53.161
truth, across perspective, glare, blur,
noise and resolution.

00:03:53.321 --> 00:03:58.397
On the gauge, the mean absolute error is
under half a PSI, and

00:03:58.397 --> 00:04:02.298
fewer than one in a hundred published
readings is wrong by more than

00:04:02.298 --> 00:04:08.091
a few PSI. Indicators are classified at
better than 98 percent precision and

00:04:08.091 --> 00:04:13.734
recall. A frame is analysed in about 22
milliseconds on a CPU, and

00:04:13.734 --> 00:04:17.867
the agent completes every scripted task
inside its bounds.

00:04:18.249 --> 00:04:24.148
SightOps runs on a single CPU machine, with
a real OpenCV 5 pipeline,

00:04:24.148 --> 00:04:28.862
a bounded agent loop, an approval gate, and
a complete audit trail.

00:04:29.023 --> 00:04:33.250
It is open source and a working product
rather than a prototype.

00:04:33.342 --> 00:04:38.231
You take a photograph. It measures, it
reasons, it asks, and it acts

00:04:38.231 --> 00:04:41.076
safely. See. Diagnose. Act.

